    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are delighted to present this charming stone-built traditional farmhouse-style, two-storey dwellinghouse. Located approximately 6km west of the Twin Towns of Ballybofey and Stranorlar in the scenic area of Glenfin. Overlooking the minor R253 road, the house comes with two small storage sheds plus a garden area on the opposite side of the road. Internal accommodation comprises of sitting room, living room (with oil-fired range), kitchen and shower room on the ground floor with three bedrooms on the first floor. This property has been vacant for a number of years and should qualify for both the vacant homes improvement grants plus the S.E.A.I. Energy Upgrade Grants (subject to eligibility). Offering great potential, this property will generate lots of enquiries. Early viewing is strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "<br><br>\nHallway - 4.6m x 1.8m <br>Floor tiled. \nReturn stairs leading to first floor. <br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.6m x 3.7m <br>Open fire with tiled fireplace. \nDual aspect windows. \nCarpeted floor. \nTongue and groove timber ceiling. \n<br><br><br>\nLiving Room - 4.6m x 4m <br>Oil fired Stanley range. \nFront facing window. \nLinoleum flooring. \nTongue and groove timber ceiling. <br><br><br>\nKitchen - 4.4m x 3.2m <br>High and low level kitchen units. \nDual aspect windows. \nPVC back door. \nStainless steel sink.<br><br><br>\nShower Room - 2m X 1.7m <br>WC and WHB.\nWet-room style electric shower. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.6m x 3.7m <br>Open fire with slate fireplace.\nDual aspect windows. \nTongue and groove partly vaulted timber ceiling. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.3m x 2.5m <br>Front facing window. \nTongue and groove partly vaulted timber ceiling. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 2.5m x 2.5m <br>Front facing window. \nTongue and groove partly vaulted timber ceiling. <br><br><br>\nLean-To Attached Garage - 5.5m x 4.5m <br>Pedestrian door. \nVehicle door. \nConcrete floored. \nCorrugated iron roof. <br><br><br>\nDetached Garage - 6m x 5.2m <br>Vehicle door. \nConcrete floor. \nCorrugated iron roof.<br><br>"
      },
